			"notes": "Your T3 Code agents as characters in an office in your Minecraft world.\n\n**Install (official Minecraft Launcher):** quit the launcher, then run one command.\n\n- macOS / Linux: `curl -fsSL https://github.com/alexandros-lekkas/t3craft/releases/latest/download/install.sh | bash`\n- Windows (PowerShell): `irm https://github.com/alexandros-lekkas/t3craft/releases/latest/download/install.ps1 | iex`\n\nThen open T3 Code, press Play on *T3 Craft* and click **T3 World**. Modrinth App and Prism users can import `t3craft-0.6.0.mrpack`. See [docs/INSTALL.md](https://github.com/alexandros-lekkas/t3craft/blob/main/docs/INSTALL.md) for every option and [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/alexandros-lekkas/t3craft/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md) for what is new."
